WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.660
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.660
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:33.510
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:33.510
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.930
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.930
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.730
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.730
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:49.940
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:49.940
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:52.940
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:52.940
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.150
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.150
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.910
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.910
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.910
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:04.870
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:04.870
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:07.960
Keep your eyes on me, okay?!

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:07.960
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:36.610
I'm Kurata Sana, first year of
junior high school student.

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:38.700
Mysterious commenting white bat, Babbit.

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:41.080
It's the 100th episode anniversary!

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:44.290
My best friend,
Hayama Akito.

00:01:44.290 --> 00:01:45.620
Karate Club?

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:50.040
Let the Jinbo Middle School know
how cool amusing and dandy the Karate is

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:54.710
...and add more friends and win
the district competitions and the Olympics!

00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:55.840
Hey you...

00:01:55.840 --> 00:01:57.930
Are you interested in Karate?

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:19.700
I have to go to school.

00:02:23.030 --> 00:02:27.080
I have to go to school, I have to.

00:02:33.880 --> 00:02:35.670
We're gonna be late.

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:50.600
The Blackboard Erasers
Disappeared

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:54.110
So I'm gonna let him rest at home.

00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:58.030
Yes, give my regards to Sengoku-sensei.

00:02:58.860 --> 00:03:01.820
Shouta, I called the school, ok?

00:03:01.820 --> 00:03:03.320
Yeah, thanks.

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:07.660
But you never were absent in
elementary school.

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:10.080
Your record is broken now.

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:13.250
I just was too excited after
yesterday's school activity.

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:14.590
Activity?

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:17.340
- Yeah, the Karate Club.
- Karate Club?

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:20.300
I'm alright. If I rest one day
I'll be okay.

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:23.300
- Are you sure?
- Hey, help me out here!

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:26.850
Coming!
So I can't come back at noon.

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:29.100
- You, take the phone!
- Okay!

00:03:41.150 --> 00:03:42.490
Absent!

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:48.370
My record of not being late and perfect attendance...

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:50.540
is completely ruined.

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:58.630
I guess Sengoku-sensei will be
disappointed.

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:06.850
I guess Hayama-kun will be in
trouble because of me.

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:13.480
I wonder why Sengoku-sensei and
Hayama-kun have such a bad relationship.

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:17.020
But both of them are kinda cool.

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:23.740
I want to be cool like them too.

00:04:23.740 --> 00:04:25.410
You're kinda weird.

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:32.620
I can't be a weakling like this.
Tomorrow I'll go to school definitely.

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:37.960
I have to take back today's part.
The karate club is so hard-working,

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:40.590
I admire them,
I'm glad that I'm in it.

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:42.630
Oh yeah.

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:46.140
Where are you going?
You have to sleep!

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:50.720
Hey, what are you doing? Hey!

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:55.650
- Brother, dinner.
- What's today's dinner?

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:57.190
Are you sleeping?

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:59.690
- Go to prepare the dinner!
- I'm hungry!

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:01.820
Order something for today.

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:03.280
Alright!

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:07.700
Damn it! Hey, don't touch that.

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:09.780
That's because you put it there!

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:14.410
It's our precious attendance
name plates.

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:19.420
- Seafood taste griddle cake?
- There will be many seafoods on it.

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:20.630
That looks delicious.

00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:23.170
Hayama-kun!

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:25.800
Good morning!

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:29.010
He's angry after all.

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:32.010
- I forgot his name again.
- What?!

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:35.770
I'm sorry being out of school
yesterday.

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:40.570
So... And about today's practice...

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:46.320
Don't worry about it.
You're not fit for karate.

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:49.200
Bye!

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:58.120
Um...

00:05:58.460 --> 00:06:01.090
Sorry about yesterday.

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:05.590
I... I was absent.

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:09.340
What? You're in my class?

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:13.560
Hurry and back to class.

00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:24.900
Yama... yama no... yama no anata...

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:27.190
It's not Yamano Anata!

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:29.320
Yamano Anatano Soratoku.

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:32.200
Let's... sleep... together!

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:35.490
Are you a utayako or something?!

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:38.660
Idiot! Do you know what an utayako is?

00:06:38.870 --> 00:06:39.870
Oh, nobody cares about me.

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:42.920
My grandfather laughs so hard
with them!

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:45.920
Excuse me...

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:49.130
I wanna clean up.
Can you move?

00:06:58.940 --> 00:07:02.270
One more push, Hayama!
We'll have enough members.

00:07:02.270 --> 00:07:05.070
Let's make a big campaign and get
one more person!

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:10.070
Tokyo has more than 1 million people!
We could find at least one person.

00:07:10.070 --> 00:07:11.320
Absolutely, you're right.

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:14.240
- It's two more people.
- Isn't it one more person?

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:17.540
Don't look at Sana-chan so lowly
like that. She can do math!

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:20.790
- One person is out now.
- Who?

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:22.880
It's not me!

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:26.170
If you're here, Sana-chan, then
I'll always be with you...

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:28.630
That one with the voice like a girl.

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:30.630
Huh? Nakakaruizawa-kun?

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:33.510
No, it's not Nakakaruizawa,
it's Nakanoshima.

00:07:33.510 --> 00:07:35.600
Isn't that way different.
So who is it?

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:37.310
Nobody remembers it??

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:39.430
Hey, nosebleed, did you see
the notebook?

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:43.400
Yes, I'll look for it,
but my name isn't nosebleed.

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:45.560
- Oh, it's Nakao-kun.
- Oh yeah.

00:07:45.730 --> 00:07:47.270
Nakao-kun quit?

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:49.240
Yeah, he was absent yesterday,

00:07:49.240 --> 00:07:51.820
so I thought it was kinda
dangerous. Yesterday morning...

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:52.910
He's really quit?

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:56.490
He kinda looked too scared to say it, so I asked him to.

00:07:56.740 --> 00:07:58.200
Eh, is that so?!

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:02.250
He was such a precious member who wanted to do it from his own will...

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:05.580
Compared to some weak manager who
was looking for a girl,

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:07.290
he had more will power.

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:08.710
What do you mean by that?!

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:10.170
Exactly what it means!

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:13.130
Hayama, did you train him really
hard from the first day?

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:16.510
I don't remember training hard.
I think he worked hard too.

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:20.520
Observe him for a while and give
him one more chance, okay?

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:22.180
Give it up.

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:24.810
Sana-chan, let's work hard with me,

00:08:24.810 --> 00:08:26.860
and get more decent members.

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:31.280
I mean, come on, he didn't look cool when he was practicing.

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:34.490
How to say? He's not cool enough to be a karate club member.

00:08:34.700 --> 00:08:36.700
Karate is not about looking cool!

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:39.540
- Don't glare at me like that.
- Who's glaring at you?

00:08:39.540 --> 00:08:41.750
Yeah, you are glaring at me.

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:43.710
Well, well, stop it.

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:46.630
Let's think about the campaign
more seriously.

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:49.300
It if turns out like this, I think
I'll do something like be a bunny girl!

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:54.470
His nose is bleeding!

00:08:54.470 --> 00:08:56.470
Yeah, you are good as nose bleeder.

00:08:56.680 --> 00:08:58.390
Anyway, we will do the campaign.

00:08:58.550 --> 00:09:00.720
- Yeah, yeah, say it, Hayama!
- Stop it!

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:02.730
Why isn't life all about yelling?

00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:05.020
Sana-chan, are you really gonna be
a bunny girl?

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:08.110
Yes, I will.
He's bleeding again!

00:09:11.190 --> 00:09:13.030
- Dinner ready?
- What's it this time?

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:14.650
Not curry again!

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:17.870
Brother, we don't want curry anymore, we want pizza!

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:26.290
Wait, it's burnt...

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:28.000
- I like burnt ones!
- Not me!

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:30.960
You're not fit for karate.

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:37.260
- Are you tired?
- I'm fine.

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:41.930
What? You're in my class?

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:45.060
You're in my class...

00:09:48.060 --> 00:09:51.570
I wonder what I am.

00:09:57.700 --> 00:09:59.620
- Two more.
- Yes!

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:02.120
- Mom, I want breakfast!
- Where's your brother?

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:04.540
He's not there. He already
went to school.

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:06.080
Eh? So early?

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:08.330
Breakfast, breakfast.

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:11.590
I guess I can't be helped.
Father, I'm sorry.

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:12.800
Wait a minute, please.

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:16.760
- Alright, mom's breakfast!
- Fried rice, fried rice!

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:23.930
Hey, Nichoku,
the eraser's not here.

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:27.520
Yes! Er...
What am I supposed to do?

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:33.020
Sorry to keep waiting! I, Kurata Sana, the nichoku, has delivered the eraser to you.

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:34.780
Thanks, Kurata.

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:38.320
What're you talking about?
It's expected as a nichoku's job.

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:41.780
Sana-chan, you weren't nichoku for
a long time so you're happy, aren't you?

00:10:41.780 --> 00:10:46.160
Amazing! Outside the utility room scrabble for the eraser with
other nichokus.

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:49.000
It's hard but I won't lose to
other nichokus.

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:52.170
Because it's my character that
I will never give up.

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:55.380
Of course
I got the eraser at last!

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:59.130
So other classroom's erasers
missed?

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:03.010
Now erasers are the precious
treasure in school.

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:17.570
{parte b}

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:21.740
Karate Club is a good place
to come for a bit!

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:24.530
Sana-chan,
a bunny girl looks like that?

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:30.250
Smiling is good,
do karate to do this!

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:31.960
Ok, Hayama, dance!

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:37.300
Damn it. Is this good enough?

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:42.260
Come on, nowadays there's not that
many karate freaks in middle school.

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:44.350
I think everyone liked it.

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:45.970
Why did you make it humorous?

00:11:45.970 --> 00:11:48.140
Don't expect results so suddenly.

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:53.600
Didn't Nakao-kun work hard? Maybe
his example is worth to be refered to.

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:57.610
I know, let's make a karate club
counseling corner.

00:11:57.610 --> 00:12:00.360
Kind of like we will answer all
of your questions!

00:12:00.360 --> 00:12:02.200
Oh, that's good, right, right?

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:03.860
Oh, I don't care.

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:05.700
Don't put on
a gloomy face like that!

00:12:05.700 --> 00:12:07.950
On Earth there are 32 billion people,

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:11.250
one, two or three karate club members are nothing! Ah ha ha...!

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:12.920
You have no authority saying
something like that!

00:12:12.920 --> 00:12:14.710
- Hey you...
- What is it?

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:17.920
Why are you working so hard?

00:12:19.260 --> 00:12:21.970
- Because it is fun!
- Yes, yes.

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:26.300
Mom, can we order ramen?

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:27.680
Eh? Where's your brother?

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:29.890
He hasn't come back home yet.
Isn't ramen ok?

00:12:30.060 --> 00:12:32.980
I wonder why. It's already late.
Maybe it's an after school activity...

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:34.350
Hurry up!

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:36.270
Is it ok? I'm hungry!

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:38.110
Ok ok, you can order it.

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:40.730
Alright! Without brother
we're so lucky, huh!

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:44.320
Hayama!

00:12:44.450 --> 00:12:45.740
Good morning!

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:49.740
What is it... you're so hyper in
the morning.

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:51.750
I'm excited because I've got lots
of good ideas,

00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:54.750
so I wanted to tell you as soon as possible.

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:58.250
What did you made this for?

00:12:58.250 --> 00:13:00.250
We're gonna
tape it in our meeting room.

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:02.300
Most of it is stuff that won't do
us any good.

00:13:02.300 --> 00:13:03.840
That's not true.

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:08.680
The 3rd one,
I've almost solved it.

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:17.100
How is it?

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:20.730
Hey, listen to it!

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:23.030
- First we change the manager.
- No way.

00:13:23.110 --> 00:13:25.650
I will at least accept
your hard work.

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:30.120
What about asking Nakao-kun again?
Let's do it.

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:34.500
- Good morning.
- Good morning.

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:38.630
Sengoku-sensei,
can I have a moment?

00:13:38.920 --> 00:13:41.920
It's your student's
Nakao Shouta's mother.

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:43.420
Nice to meet you.

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:47.010
Actually Nakao-kun didn't
come home last night.

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:53.390
Me and my husband have a small
transportation company

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:55.230
so we wake up early
and work really late.

00:13:55.520 --> 00:14:00.060
Our two little sons,
Shouta looks after them.

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:02.780
So we just left it all to him.

00:14:02.780 --> 00:14:07.110
Um... it's embarrassing when we
realized that Shouta wasn't home,

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:08.990
it wasn't until yesterday night.

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:12.580
So before then Nakao-kun
wasn't home?

00:14:12.580 --> 00:14:15.250
I haven't seen him since
yesterday morning.

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:18.580
Sengoku-sensei,
did you see him in school?

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:22.420
Uh? Yesterday...
he was absent.

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:25.630
So that means he was missed from
yesterday morning.

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:29.470
Shouta never was off from
elementary school.

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:36.230
His health is not so strong. So he
made up a goal that he would never be absent.

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:41.940
Sengoku-sensei, was there any
peculiar fact two days ago about Nakao-kun?

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:44.110
- No, not really.
- You must haven't cared about it.

00:14:45.690 --> 00:14:49.200
You probably don't even know
who Nakao-kun is!

00:14:49.200 --> 00:14:51.240
He was absent 3 days ago too.

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:53.030
From which day on?

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:56.290
He was absent because he felt
exhausted for an after school activity.

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:59.870
- An after school activity?
- Yeah. He started Karate or something.

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:04.130
He doesn't really like sports,
so I'm wondering what happened to him.

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:07.010
- Did you just say Karate?
- Eh? Yeah...

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:11.640
Kyoto-sensei, this has to be Hayama.

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:12.680
Hayama-kun?

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:15.680
This karate club is something that
Hayama made.

00:15:16.270 --> 00:15:20.270
He's trying to justify his
violence, that's why he made it.

00:15:20.350 --> 00:15:23.110
But that has nothing to do with
Nakao-kun.

00:15:23.110 --> 00:15:26.020
You said Nakao-kun isn't the type of person who would do karate, right?

00:15:26.020 --> 00:15:27.070
Yes.

00:15:27.070 --> 00:15:30.820
Hayama must have pulled him in
without his consent.

00:15:31.610 --> 00:15:35.030
There's no doubt that Hayama is
involved in this.

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:37.160
This Hayama...

00:15:37.490 --> 00:15:41.120
Hayama is a troublemaker, and has
caused many problems before.

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:45.590
Sengoku-sensei, the last incident
was all misunderstanding.

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:47.460
You shouldn't prejudge.

00:15:47.460 --> 00:15:52.550
I had a feeling that he would do bad again. So we'd better expel him sooner.

00:15:53.090 --> 00:15:55.760
Principal,
we should ask Hayama-kun

00:15:55.850 --> 00:15:59.020
about how Nakao-kun was acting in
Karate club.

00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:03.690
Again.
Hayama is called

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:03.560
Damnit,
again in a bad situation.

00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:04.900
Good morning!

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:06.980
- Oh, Sana-chan!
- What's wrong?

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:09.940
I know it's sudden, can you think
of the Karat club symbol?

00:16:10.030 --> 00:16:13.280
Whoever's symbol gets chosen, will
be named as an honorable Karate club member.

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:16.740
Sana-chan, doesn't that sound like
an evil business?

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:18.240
Hayama, where is Nakao-kun?

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:20.000
I'm not really sure...

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:22.790
Hayama-kun, can I have a minute?

00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:24.790
Ah, Sengoku-sensei...

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:27.130
Class 1 Nakao-kun is missing...

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:29.840
Suzuki-sensei, I've told you before.

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:33.630
If you get involved with Hayama-kun's karate club, nothing good will happen.

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:36.300
What do you mean by that?

00:16:36.600 --> 00:16:39.810
Nakao-kun's disappearance must have Hayama involved.

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:44.440
For it's dangerous for Hayama-kun
to make Karate club...

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:46.360
So have you thought it over?

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:52.070
I firmly believe that they have
made the Karate club with passion.

00:16:52.190 --> 00:16:54.240
How long can you be so optimistic?

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:57.530
A member of the Karate Club,
Nakao-kun is missing!

00:16:58.120 --> 00:17:02.370
Are you saying that with a
definite reason?

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:06.120
Reason? That quiet Nakao joined
the Karate club

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:09.670
and this club was made by Hayama!
That's reason enough.

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:14.880
Sensei, what do you have
against Hayama?

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:19.050
A person who rots once will never
get back to normal again.

00:17:19.430 --> 00:17:21.270
He's a dangerous child.

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:25.020
He's a human that must be eliminated before he gets rotten any further.

00:17:27.600 --> 00:17:28.900
Excuse me.

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:39.240
Nakao!

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:43.830
Sengoku-sensei, please help me!

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:48.080
I don't know what I am anymore.

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:53.630
If I disappear,
will somebody worry about me?

00:17:55.800 --> 00:17:57.180
What the hell is this?

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:02.350
When Hayama-kun asked me to join
the Karate Club

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:06.390
I was so happy that Hayama-kun
talked to me,

00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:09.980
I didn't think much of what would
happen later if I joined.

00:18:10.560 --> 00:18:14.280
But I never knew that the training would be so hard.

00:18:14.280 --> 00:18:17.240
Even I tried my best,

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:22.330
it was too heavy for me. And the
next day, my body wouldn't listen to me.

00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:25.660
And finally I had to stay home
from school.

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:32.840
I have never been absent from
school but that was my only pride,

00:18:33.630 --> 00:18:36.630
I broke that record myself,

00:18:37.670 --> 00:18:42.100
but Hayama said that I can't do
Karate anymore so

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:47.600
I was really sad. My no absence
record is destroyed,

00:18:47.640 --> 00:18:53.440
and I was made to quit Karate Club,
I have nothing left anymore!

00:18:56.780 --> 00:18:57.940
Hayama...

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:02.490
You wanted a reason, right?
I got one.

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:06.750
That letter,
didn't have a second page?

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:09.160
Kurata-san, why are you here?

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:10.790
Don't mind me.

00:19:11.380 --> 00:19:16.300
I bet something happened. Hayama
made no explanation and the atmosphere is bad.

00:19:16.630 --> 00:19:20.760
Actually, Class 1 Nakao-kun was
missing since yesterday.

00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:22.550
Nakao-kun is missing?

00:19:24.810 --> 00:19:27.180
Now I could definitely get Hayama
away from this school.

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:30.480
Wait, shouldn't you read the
2nd page of the letter!

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:32.400
Yeah, did you... notice?

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:35.270
Hey hey, what does it say?
Hey, read it!

00:19:35.570 --> 00:19:37.280
What is this?

00:19:42.610 --> 00:19:45.490
What a naivety guy!

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:49.830
What is it in that letter?

00:19:50.210 --> 00:19:52.620
Now he's acting like an evil
person.

00:19:52.960 --> 00:19:56.590
Hayama-kun, you asked Nakao-kun to join the Karate club.

00:19:56.590 --> 00:19:58.840
Were you on friendly terms
with him before that?

00:19:58.960 --> 00:20:01.380
No, just common friends.

00:20:01.930 --> 00:20:04.010
How did you feel about him?

00:20:04.340 --> 00:20:06.430
How?
He sounded like a girl...

00:20:06.720 --> 00:20:11.600
What he means is he was girlish as
in cute and anybody will like him.

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:12.940
Hey, you're not following here.

00:20:13.400 --> 00:20:16.020
Not what type he is,

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:18.280
but how he was acting.

00:20:18.280 --> 00:20:23.610
Well, he was the quiet sort of person but he was hard working, right, Hayama?

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:24.530
Yeah.

00:20:24.530 --> 00:20:28.870
He came to the Karate club on his
own will and trained hard.

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:29.750
Yeah.

00:20:29.750 --> 00:20:31.870
But did he say he wanted to quit?

00:20:31.870 --> 00:20:33.460
No, I thought it was too hard for him.

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:36.540
So that your club had those
torturous training exercises?

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:37.960
They were not torturous!

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:39.380
Answer for yourself, Hayama.

00:20:39.380 --> 00:20:41.340
It was normal training.

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:44.890
Nakao-kun tried his best but it was too much for him.

00:20:45.390 --> 00:20:48.350
Nakao had so much damage that he
couldn't go to school the next day,

00:20:48.470 --> 00:20:50.600
I can't think it was a normal training.

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:55.190
Maybe Nakao-kun is too weak to do it.

00:20:55.850 --> 00:20:58.440
So are you going to keep
trying to make it Nakao's fault?

00:20:58.570 --> 00:21:02.360
Principal, this is Nakao's letter
to me, please read it.

00:21:06.570 --> 00:21:08.030
This is...

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:13.410
Want to read it?

00:21:19.800 --> 00:21:22.670
If you read this letter, then
everything is out in the open.

00:21:22.670 --> 00:21:25.380
Hayama is the one who pressured
him into this!

00:21:26.510 --> 00:21:27.760
He...

00:21:28.140 --> 00:21:29.430
Hayama...

00:21:29.680 --> 00:21:33.180
Hayama, how are you going to
apologize to Nakao's parents?

00:21:33.180 --> 00:21:36.350
If some big thing happens, then
there's no way to apologize.

00:21:37.190 --> 00:21:38.560
I...

00:21:38.770 --> 00:21:40.230
Apologize!

00:21:40.520 --> 00:21:42.690
Can't you even apologize?!

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:44.650
Hayama!

00:21:47.110 --> 00:21:51.030
Now we should focus on Nakao-kun first.

00:21:51.580 --> 00:21:54.790
Exactly what Kurata-san says.
We should be worried about Nakao-kun.

00:21:54.790 --> 00:21:57.750
- Mrs. Nakao, please call the police.
- Yes.

00:21:57.750 --> 00:22:01.250
Head teacher, please go with her to
find Nakao.

00:22:07.220 --> 00:22:08.760
That guy...

00:22:10.640 --> 00:22:13.890
He didn't want to quit?

00:22:14.560 --> 00:22:15.680
Hayama...

00:22:16.100 --> 00:22:19.600
Hayama-kun,
I don't care how little it is,

00:22:19.600 --> 00:22:22.770
please remember something about
Nakao-kun and tell me.

00:22:23.150 --> 00:22:25.110
Sengoku-sensei,

00:22:25.110 --> 00:22:28.990
let's think about the disappearance of the erasers.

